flowchart LR
    MIC[Microphone<br/>sounddevice] --> STREAM[Persistent audio stream]
    STREAM --> VAD[VAD + RMS meter]
    VAD --> STT[faster-whisper<br/>offline transcription]
    STT --> WAKE[Wake-word + fuzzy intent layer]

    WAKE -->|wake detected| BRAIN[Gemini Brain<br/>temperature 0.4]
    WAKE -->|Mark 50 / Iron Man intent| HUD_ANIM[HUD animation trigger]
    BRAIN -->|tool call| DISPATCH[Grounded tool dispatcher]
    BRAIN -->|natural request| RESPONSE[Natural response]

    DISPATCH --> WEB[Network tools<br/>weather + web search]
    DISPATCH --> OS[OS tools<br/>apps + media + browser + files]
    DISPATCH --> MEMORY[SQLite tools<br/>alarms + reminders + facts]
    WEB --> CONTRACT[TOOL_OK / TOOL_ERROR / TOOL_RESULT]
    OS --> CONTRACT
    MEMORY --> CONTRACT
    CONTRACT --> BRAIN_RESULT[Verified spoken result]
    RESPONSE --> TTS[edge-tts]
    BRAIN_RESULT --> TTS
    TTS --> SPEAKER[Speaker output]

    MEMORY --> WORKER[Background alarm/reminder worker]
    WORKER -->|due item| SPEAKER

    BRAIN -. latency .-> TELEMETRY[Cached telemetry]
    STREAM -. audio level .-> TELEMETRY
    TELEMETRY --> HUD[Threaded Tony Stark HUD<br/>splash.py]
    HUD_ANIM --> HUD

    classDef input fill:#071b2d,stroke:#31c7ff,color:#e9fbff;
    classDef brain fill:#24124a,stroke:#b784ff,color:#fff;
    classDef tool fill:#3a1d0b,stroke:#ffb347,color:#fff;
    classDef output fill:#102d20,stroke:#54e38e,color:#effff4;
    classDef hud fill:#1b193d,stroke:#ff4e70,color:#fff;

    class MIC,STREAM,VAD,STT,WAKE input;
    class BRAIN,DISPATCH,CONTRACT,BRAIN_RESULT brain;
    class WEB,OS,MEMORY,WORKER tool;
    class RESPONSE,TTS,SPEAKER output;
    class HUD_ANIM,TELEMETRY,HUD hud;
